   "contentDescription": "Illustration of the hand of the Cristo statue showing a paramedic getting out of a helicopter and running to a bleeding finger."
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "Essentials of Rio de Janeiro",
   "size": "EXTRA_LARGE",
   "variant": "HEADLINE"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>18. June 2025 | 2 min read | Lufthansa Editorial Team</b>",
   "size": "SMALL",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Legal graffiti art and a ban on bikinis: five things about Rio de Janeiro that will surprise you.</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Graffiti Allowed!&nbsp;</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "Rio would not be so&nbsp;colorful without its street art. The city has paid tribute to the artists by&nbsp;legalizing spray-painting as far as possible: public buildings are also permitted as long as they are not listed buildings. One of the largest works is the 3,000 square&nbsp;meter mural \"Etnias\" in the&nbsp;harbor area.&nbsp;",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "image",
   "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/south-america/essentials-of-rio-de-janeiro/lh_app_rio-de-janeiro_illustration1_sylvia-neuner_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
   "contentDescription": "Two illustrations. On the left, a person sits on a roof in a favela and sprays a graffiti heart into the sky. On the right, a ship on a river forming the word Rio."
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Mix-up with Consequences</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "Rio de Janeiro translates as \"January River.\" The name originated when Portuguese sailors landed in a bay in January 1502, which they mistook for the mouth of a river. When the town's foundations were laid in 1565, the term became part of its name.&nbsp;",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "spacer",
   "size": "MEDIUM"
  },
